# Files in docker/ that no image of `make docker-images` is built from: the gVisor installer
# and its test, its pinned versions, the seccomp profile the host applies at run time, and the
# agent-sandbox image's recipe (built on its own, from the project image). Keeping them
# out of the build context also keeps them out of the hash `make docker-images` stamps
# on each image, so editing one does not mark the images stale. One literal path per
# line, no patterns: the Makefile's hash reads this file as a plain list.
gvisor.versions
install-gvisor.sh
install_gvisor_test.go
seccomp.json
agentsandbox.Dockerfile
